{"id":"g2099","title":"Echinadoron®","description":"Anwendungsbeschreibung für Echinadoron® Lutschtabletten bei Pharyngitis und Tonsillopharyngitis zur Linderung der Halsschmerzen innerhalb eines Tages.","blocks":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"list","children":[{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Synonym:"}]},{"type":"inline","id":"11285","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Echinacea/Calendula comp."}]},{"type":"text","text":" Lutschtabletten (WELEDA CH). "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Hersteller"}]},{"type":"text","text":": WELEDA CH. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Zusammensetzung"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Calendula officinalis, Herba Ø; Echinacea angustifolia, Planta tota Ø; Chamomilla recutita, Flos Ø. "}]}]}]},{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"children":[{"type":"text","text":"Indikationen"}]}]},{"type":"group","id":"indication","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"heading","level":4,"children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"text","text":" Pharyngitis und Tonsillopharyngitis "}]}]},{"type":"group","id":"a2074","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"text","text":" Mit Halsschmerzen bei gerötetem Rachen, auch wenn die Tonsillen mitbetroffen sind, jedoch keine ausgeprägte Schwellung oder Belagbildung aufweisen. "}]},{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"list","children":[{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Dosierung"}]},{"type":"text","text":": 3–5 x tgl. 1 Tbl. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Wirkungseintritt"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Innerhalb eines Tages Linderung der Halsschmerzen. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Therapiedauer"}]},{"type":"text","text":": 3–7 Tg. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Bemerkungen"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Das als Lutschtablette vorliegende Arzneimittel wird erfahrungsgemäß vor allem auch von Jugendlichen geschätzt. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Berichtender Arzt"}]},{"type":"text","text":": AA. "}]}]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"heading","id":"01JJ73XEM0Z6QF1QN2CXF7Y1YJ","level":4,"children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"text","text":" Zugelassenes Anwendungsgebiet "}]}]},{"type":"group","id":"application-01JJ73XEM0Z6QF1QN2CXF7Y1YJ","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Zur Linderung von Hals- und Rachenentzündungen und Stärkung der Abwehrkräfte gegen Erkältungen."}]}]}]}]},{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"heading","id":"R2099","level":4,"children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"text","text":" Literatur "}]}]},{"type":"group","id":"literature-R2099","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Mennet-von Eiff M, Hibou F. Echinadoron NF Lutschtabletten. In: Meyer U, Pedersen PA (Hg). Anthroposophische Pharmazie. Grundlagen, Herstellprozesse, Arzneimittel. 1. Aufl. Berlin: Salumed-Verlag 2016; 745–750."}]}]}]}]}]}]}